abstract: >-
  Electrothermal DCO-OFDM LiFi simulator, learned and model-based DC-bias controllers,
  evaluation code, and the stored results of the benchmark reported in the manuscript
  "Learned or Model-Based DC-Bias Control for DCO-OFDM LiFi? A Simulation Benchmark Under
  LED Model Error and Device Shift".
